sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as MCP client
    participant R as hpe-networking-mcp
    participant T as Tool catalog
    participant B as Backend server
    participant A as Vendor API

    U->>C: Show critical Central alerts
    C->>R: find_tool("critical alerts")
    R->>T: semantic + keyword lookup
    T-->>R: list_active_alerts (read)
    R-->>C: compact schema and safety metadata
    C->>R: invoke_read_tool(...)
    R->>B: dispatch validated arguments
    B->>A: bounded API request
    A-->>B: JSON response
    B-->>R: normalized result
    R-->>C: response envelope + rate metadata
